  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“花塢”這個名字，大約是曾經到過杭州，或在杭州居住過幾年的人，無人不知，特別是遊覽西溪的人，幾乎都會造訪花塢。",
      "output_sha256": "3b1d96d4200ec1af9059bff77d341c7ab83aeda460dc3627a37ad260156ba4ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.599592,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "729818178214e1d157be9f829b16b7233ecd02a409ced1427bed8588b0ad6e51"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3b1d96d4200ec1af9059bff77d341c7ab83aeda460dc3627a37ad260156ba4ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二三十年前，汽車不通，公路未築，要去遊一次，真不容易；所以明明知道花塢的幽深清絕，但腳力不健，非好遊如好色的詩人，不大會去。",
      "output_sha256": "9b948a4cd81bcd7042aa49a84b8f163edf902bfaf3b36cfaca1380184e9bc181",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b948a4cd81bcd7042aa49a84b8f163edf902bfaf3b36cfaca1380184e9bc181",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "現在可不同了，從湖濱向北向西的坐汽車去，不消半個鐘頭，就能到花塢口外。",
      "output_sha256": "ff9e6b9b8c7d20f678d118af446e0f38ea721a6e69cf9ef6aa8b853048386d96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff9e6b9b8c7d20f678d118af446e0f38ea721a6e69cf9ef6aa8b853048386d96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而花塢的住民，每到了春秋佳日的放假日期，也會成羣結隊，在花塢口的那座涼亭裏鵠候，預備來做一個臨時導遊的腳色，好輕輕快快地賺取遊客的兩毛小洋；現在的花塢，可真成了第二雲棲，或第三九溪十八澗了。",
      "output_sha256": "95682e366ee5b5df3749e123f7cbfb5db1b1a7d702757e71c04a2e42ef538c8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "95682e366ee5b5df3749e123f7cbfb5db1b1a7d702757e71c04a2e42ef538c8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "花塢的獨特之處在於三面環山，地勢深幽，石人塢不及其幽深，龍歸塢更無其秀美。",
      "output_sha256": "17414f45441600694b1fbbefd735eca9331102e35e5df33ec7b4cfe5144adc1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.51766,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "049acde958a2a38476c3d5b7ea5a479b3f57a434b4c2211a3ad4dd31403a42d2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "17414f45441600694b1fbbefd735eca9331102e35e5df33ec7b4cfe5144adc1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而竹木蕭疏，清溪蜿繞，庵堂錯落，尼媼翩翩，更是花塢獨有的迷人風韻。",
      "output_sha256": "e0125c935bc95d1cc445e199ccbdd91b150163cf8327ffd69f875ccc41a7c4ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0125c935bc95d1cc445e199ccbdd91b150163cf8327ffd69f875ccc41a7c4ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "將人來比花塢，就像潯陽商婦，老抱琵琶；將花來比花塢，更像碧桃開謝，未死春心；將菜來比花塢，只好說冬菇燒豆腐，湯清而味雋了。",
      "output_sha256": "ea9708d7f9831b1f3d7855235b46abbbd74ea0253e2fe63ad6473c171c770665",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea9708d7f9831b1f3d7855235b46abbbd74ea0253e2fe63ad6473c171c770665",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我第一次前往花塢，是在松木場放馬山後養病的時候，記得那是一天日和風靜的清秋午後，乘坐黃包車，經過古蕩，過了東嶽，看過伴風居，拜訪過風木庵（丁氏的別業），感到口渴，就詢問車伕附近是否有清靜的乞茶之處？",
      "output_sha256": "bfc5b3d5a1ca31cda9669c219afc95a7567a2078d90c4245ed3218a1ce588722",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.748126,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c81bb1f1c93cd3d1106f2ce055c4d5cb42680f42370a08f2cf6dbed091862b4d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bfc5b3d5a1ca31cda9669c219afc95a7567a2078d90c4245ed3218a1ce588722",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他便將我帶到了花塢的中間。",
      "output_sha256": "bfa839547bf76aed05d47e6e6ae5d99b8e1ab45acbb8b6b9350d1f2ada0817da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.675,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4253a292dcf4879cb203193154a5bb6d26512a8858d49ea0e86bd882c5d06ea1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bfa839547bf76aed05d47e6e6ae5d99b8e1ab45acbb8b6b9350d1f2ada0817da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "伴風居雖則結構堂皇，可是裏面卻也坍敗得可以；至於楊家牌樓附近的風木庵哩，丁氏的手跡尚新，茅庵的木架也在，但不曉怎麼，一走進去，就感到了一種撲人的黴灰冷氣。",
      "output_sha256": "08e00e911e58bdf3c9520d10814a3112ce97fd533db492856b5a823c922ed93c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "08e00e911e58bdf3c9520d10814a3112ce97fd533db492856b5a823c922ed93c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "當時大廳上停在那裏的兩口丁氏的棺材，想是這一種冷氣的發源之處，但泥牆傾圮，蛛網繞樑，與壁上掛在那裏的字畫屏條一對比，極自然地令人生出了“俯仰之間，已成陳跡”的感想。",
      "output_sha256": "920895d709b6d4a6de3157ae92e6ba5b90555e5daf0cf9d4d90be5083dca0f3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "920895d709b6d4a6de3157ae92e6ba5b90555e5daf0cf9d4d90be5083dca0f3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因爲剛剛在看了這兩處衰落的別墅之後，所以一到花塢，就覺得清新安逸，像世外桃源的樣子了。",
      "output_sha256": "814481d1d7cfb659d242c9c7cd80014707b43ecb0d0e5039b1158029ed59603f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "814481d1d7cfb659d242c9c7cd80014707b43ecb0d0e5039b1158029ed59603f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自北高峯後，向北直下的這一條塢裏，沒有洋樓，也沒有偉大的建築，而從竹葉雜樹中間透露出來的屋檐半角，女牆一圍，看將過去卻又顯得異常的整潔，異常的清麗。",
      "output_sha256": "7c15068126a622754f30501490af477e8fda6007e562b7afe7d19c0281c21225",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c15068126a622754f30501490af477e8fda6007e562b7afe7d19c0281c21225",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "英文字典裏有Gottage的這一個名字；而形容這些茅屋田莊的安閒小潔的字眼，又有着許多像Tiny，Dainty，Snug的絕妙佳詞，我雖則還沒有到過英國的鄉間，但到了花塢，看了這些小庵卻不能自已地便想起了這種只在小說裏讀過的英文字母。",
      "output_sha256": "13bd3803eaccb9d78ba152226d2de1e744ff1c5da1005504208f235f7a180914",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "13bd3803eaccb9d78ba152226d2de1e744ff1c5da1005504208f235f7a180914",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我手指着那些在林間散點着的小小的茅庵，回頭來就問車伕：“我們可能進去？”",
      "output_sha256": "ac380b5de7dccee31396e041cda766677fbd5fd02abdb5efeb2ed3e22de33c18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac380b5de7dccee31396e041cda766677fbd5fd02abdb5efeb2ed3e22de33c18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "車伕說：“自然是可以的。”",
      "output_sha256": "c092be5fc6b1bd9b8b3edb3fe4dbb3317a416b9ed96e6eb6de3380fcbd839752",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "c092be5fc6b1bd9b8b3edb3fe4dbb3317a416b9ed96e6eb6de3380fcbd839752",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "於是我們便沿著溪邊的小路，走上了山道的高處，來到那靜藏的雙黑板牆門外。",
      "output_sha256": "bc929fa1e97cdc5ab3deaf31b528d84206f59ed3aaddf262ac3835846b9c70e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.478321,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8033befea15564ad12df6ca163e4b011ce491b2f5d8629be43508291004f8cd6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bc929fa1e97cdc5ab3deaf31b528d84206f59ed3aaddf262ac3835846b9c70e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "車伕使勁敲了幾下，庵裏的木魚聲停了，接着門裏頭就有一位女人的聲音，問外面誰在敲門。",
      "output_sha256": "fa51496c127e9be1850531d8c7369b2e30b550d3300c6daa98945eddd2af5c46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa51496c127e9be1850531d8c7369b2e30b550d3300c6daa98945eddd2af5c46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "車伕解釋了來意，鐵門閂一響，半扇門打開，迎接我們的卻是一位白髮蒼蒼、皺紋不多的老婆婆。",
      "output_sha256": "3d613d75d6f02e58dd7b1d0b16e20743fe9a76318c25817103dd39060bcf40d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.679916,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1dc9360947d9080ce759b099fc6ca49f6b65e9a8ef647445abaf4455e2a358d6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3d613d75d6f02e58dd7b1d0b16e20743fe9a76318c25817103dd39060bcf40d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "庵裏面的潔淨，一間一間小房間的佈置的清華，以及庭前屋後樹木的參差掩映，和廳上佛座下經卷的縱橫，你若看了之後，仍不起皈依棄世之心的，我敢斷定你就是沒有感覺的木石。",
      "output_sha256": "934844972ed8695cd6c35fb602f5a044e37139ee1cc4c4371fc6c4ef8a0ea1fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "934844972ed8695cd6c35fb602f5a044e37139ee1cc4c4371fc6c4ef8a0ea1fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那位修行的老比丘尼在為我們燒茶煮水的過程中，我遠遠聽見幾聲從谷底傳來的鵲噪。",
      "output_sha256": "d7eebf932eb034010ea4abcd43fc44405fbd18e0e303bc23efa3309c00e1e5ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.621746,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aef6a531e5afc15b3f9b5cbe5293c10761101c3f7ea228ea50d496aea1b4ec14"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d7eebf932eb034010ea4abcd43fc44405fbd18e0e303bc23efa3309c00e1e5ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大約天色將晚，鳥兒回巢，谷中的靜謐因這幾聲急促的叫聲而更加深厚。",
      "output_sha256": "e5251b2bbbb250eba44b857f314e2447cc126dba55444c00aa4525de9e966459",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.621746,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aef6a531e5afc15b3f9b5cbe5293c10761101c3f7ea228ea50d496aea1b4ec14"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e5251b2bbbb250eba44b857f314e2447cc126dba55444c00aa4525de9e966459",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們靜坐著，喝完了兩壺清澈的茶後，該回去了，猶豫片刻，我掏出一張紙幣，想作為花錢的報答，那位老比丘尼卻笑了，並且婉拒道：“先生，這是不用的；我們是清修的庵，茶水不收費。”",
      "output_sha256": "6488698122dd0981ca9d59c16c47e9617a1a1fd8da89915bcb61027ab1d5ef14",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.606201,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23,
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3dd27a2bc10ebbc40b9a2ab119f0963016fe0340e1ac155493abde5126cfd43f",
        "7c594d0afea5a632b765085faef90de9a3538e72a7a1125603aa2f317cb04d44",
        "77173ee8294138945a23214178b4482b290fbb13e16ccbf6d896fcc782bf529b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6488698122dd0981ca9d59c16c47e9617a1a1fd8da89915bcb61027ab1d5ef14",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "推讓了半天，她不得已就將這一元紙幣交給了車伕，說：“這給你做個外快罷！”",
      "output_sha256": "5be9ef2fa2cbf8c53d1cd7a7650e7b05da182b0b691d34c63d1dc0698658d303",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "5be9ef2fa2cbf8c53d1cd7a7650e7b05da182b0b691d34c63d1dc0698658d303",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這老尼的風度，和這一次逛花塢的情趣，我在十餘年後的現在，還在津津地感到回味。",
      "output_sha256": "4a0b504958962ccffc0c69ddc8c0f22749fb30b6f7addfe4da5badd71a882e48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a0b504958962ccffc0c69ddc8c0f22749fb30b6f7addfe4da5badd71a882e48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以前一禮拜的星期日，和新來杭州住的幾位朋友遇見之後，他們問我“上哪裏去玩？”",
      "output_sha256": "b636a28d03aa7898c598cae2e13bafa134a93df7cf846af81e599cdaa1b817ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "b636a28d03aa7898c598cae2e13bafa134a93df7cf846af81e599cdaa1b817ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我就立時提出了花塢。",
      "output_sha256": "de86ca4483d7a16fc89d47ea804db37ad1e94b01c5b9ea2a6341ee2a9e1d2b96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "de86ca4483d7a16fc89d47ea804db37ad1e94b01c5b9ea2a6341ee2a9e1d2b96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他們是有一乘自備汽車的，經松木場，過古蕩東嶽而去花塢，只須二十分鐘，就可以到。",
      "output_sha256": "2a7f53f1d1530d15020a662ed37ecdb04b5a2a7b1a28f79befbbe68bd27606dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a7f53f1d1530d15020a662ed37ecdb04b5a2a7b1a28f79befbbe68bd27606dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十餘年來的變革，在花塢裏也留下了痕跡。",
      "output_sha256": "d1603e7b6dabff3ecedb1a9d5ad3f3bf19c9b3b26fc8d35654c14aff24ac4f30",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1603e7b6dabff3ecedb1a9d5ad3f3bf19c9b3b26fc8d35654c14aff24ac4f30",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "竹林的清幽、山溪的靜謐，雖然依然如古時一樣，但房屋增多，地價當然也水漲船高幾百倍；而最令人不快的，則是花塢的居民變成了狡猾的商人。",
      "output_sha256": "f14b3758c3633e7152d174d8efa82d893c1ca0a6117909838396cd04d5a61f55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.656493,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4d95feeb262e78c9e519474dfaa073395494047fe5e2cb76c688a07a9b0517d9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f14b3758c3633e7152d174d8efa82d893c1ca0a6117909838396cd04d5a61f55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "庵裡的尼媼，與禪院的老僧，也不再如從前般恬淡，建築物和器具等處，無一不受著歐洲低劣品味的影響。",
      "output_sha256": "97c96d44a5d826b5ecd6e08432b7401890fa76e22f59c2b6bfc606ee6b0cd4e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.567885,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "edf082e8fbdd30d1ec56b096edcee79d91c861ed7ac28d520983f819f614335e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "97c96d44a5d826b5ecd6e08432b7401890fa76e22f59c2b6bfc606ee6b0cd4e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "同去的幾位，因爲沒有見到十餘年前花塢的處女時期，所以仍舊感覺得非常滿意，以爲九溪十八澗、雲棲決沒有這樣的清幽深邃；但在我的內心，卻想起了一位素樸天真，沉靜幽嫺的少女，忽被有錢有勢的人奸了以後又被棄的狀態。",
      "output_sha256": "53fe7b46ce6ef8a67b3b00ada10d8c78323375275215d4484debbeb452ba057f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
